/* identifiers fold to upper case; $ is ignored; keywords are reserved */
abc ABC Abc$Def X1 de$clare
ADDRESS AND BASED BY BYTE CALL CASE DATA DECLARE DISABLE DO ELSE ENABLE
END EOF EXTERNAL GO GOTO HALT IF INITIAL INTERRUPT LABEL LITERALLY MINUS
MOD NOT OR PLUS PROCEDURE PUBLIC REENTRANT RETURN STRUCTURE THEN TO WHILE XOR
